gotidal (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release under the goTidal name (forked and renamed from tidalt,
    https://github.com/Benehiko/tidalt — see NOTICE and README for details).
  * rmpc-style tabbed TUI (replaces the sidebar), rmpc keybindings throughout.
  * CAVA spectrum visualizer in the Queue tab (optional; needs cava installed).
  * Synced lyrics panel, fetched from LRCLIB.
  * Square album-art rendering (accounts for the terminal's cell aspect ratio).

 -- carcuevas <https://github.com/carcuevas>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
